      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Entirely agree. Something needs to be improved here. I think the best option would probably be to add an automatic message when attempting to request, that simply says, \"Unable to request due to instance type.\"\nThis would both avoid any misunderstandings about whether someone is receiving/responding to requests that they couldn't answer, and also avoid people mistakenly assuming the request/invite button is just broken.",
